*.stl
# Scan reference meshes are captured input data, not build output: they are not
# reproducible from anything in this repo (same category as nz-ski-fields'
# committed heightmap PNGs). #198 rejected committing *derived* STLs. (#439)
!scans/**/*.stl
.cache/
.mcp-claws.json
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
